	"title": "Reclaim 0.1.1-1575",
	"body": "<!-- synopkgland:release:synopackageland%2FSynoReclaim:0.1.1-1575 -->\n\nReclaim **0.1.1-1575**\n\n0.1.1-1575\n- Phone mode now adapts correctly when opened from a browser, including iOS Safari.\n- Copying error details works inside DSM app windows.\n- Refreshed UI components with UI 0.11.4 and SDK/App/CLI/templates 0.13.1.\n\nPackage: `synopackageland/SynoReclaim`\n\n[Browse packages](https://synopkgland.com/apps/)\n\n",
	"bodyHTML": "\n<p dir=\"auto\">Reclaim <strong>0.1.1-1575</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">0.1.1-1575</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Phone mode now adapts correctly when opened from a browser, including iOS Safari.</li>\n<li>Copying error details works inside DSM app windows.</li>\n<li>Refreshed UI components with UI 0.11.4 and SDK/App/CLI/templates 0.13.1.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Package: <code class=\"notranslate\">synopackageland/SynoReclaim</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://synopkgland.com/apps/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Browse packages</a></p>",
